    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me under Section 14 of the Registration of Title Act, No.21 of 1998, I, the undersigned, hereby de-clare my determination as set out in the Schedule appended hereto in regard to the title to parcel of Land No. 127 of Block 02, con-tained in the Cadastral Map No. 320241, situated in the Village of Polgahaanga, within the Grama Niladhari Division of No. 44 - Pol-gahaanga in the Divisional Secretary's Division of Udunuwara, in the District of Kandy, in the Province of Central, referred to in Notice No. 32/0161 calling for claims to land parcels which was duly published in the Gazette No. 1969/43 of 02th June, 2016 in terms of Section 55 of the Registration of Title Act, No.21 of 1998. K.A.K. RANJITH DHARMAPALA, Commissioner of Title Settlement. Land Title Settlement Department, No. 1200/6, \u201cMihikatha Medura\u201d, Rajamalwatta Road, Battaramulla. 14th March, 2017",
